         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A composite polyphenol-rich extract improved growth performance, ruminal fermentation and immunity, while decreasing methanogenesis and excretion of nitrogen and phosphorus in growing buffaloes</rdf:li>
